    /* ── docs.html — FAQ ────────────────────────────────────────── */
    'faq-h2':              'FAQ',
    'faq-q1':              'Can I lose my deposit?',
    'faq-a1':              'No. Your principal is always withdrawable. Only the yield (the extra amount earned by Aave) is given to the winner — your original deposit stays intact.',
    'faq-q2':              'When does the draw happen?',
    'faq-a2':              'On January 1st each year. A keeper bot checks whether the year has passed and yield has accumulated, then executes the draw on-chain with no human intervention needed. You don\'t have to do anything.',
    'faq-q3':              'How do I receive my prize?',
    'faq-a3':              'Winnings are sent directly to your wallet by Aave at draw time. No claiming needed — the USDT just appears in your wallet.',
    'faq-q4':              'Why is the prize so small right now?',
    'faq-a4':              'The prize = 90% of 365 days of yield from the entire pool (10% goes to the platform). With a small pool the prize is small. As more people deposit, the annual prize grows. Invite friends to deposit and the prize gets bigger for everyone!',
    'faq-q5':              'What network is this on?',
    'faq-a5':              'Celo mainnet. Gas fees are paid in CELO and are very cheap (&lt;$0.001 per transaction). You\'ll need a small amount of CELO in your wallet for gas.',
    'faq-q6':              'Is the code open source?',
    'faq-a6':              'Yes. The smart contract source is verified on Celoscan and the full repository is public on GitHub.',

