    'docs-streak-security':           '🛡️ <strong>Security unchanged.</strong> Streak multipliers are deterministic and publicly readable on-chain — any observer can verify them anytime. They don\'t affect <em>how</em> the winner is picked, only <em>how many chances</em> each player has. An attacker can\'t manipulate their multiplier to bias the entropy accumulator — streaks are earned with real time and can\'t be faked.',

