    'docs-merit-h2':                  '🎖️ Merit Rewards (ACI)',
    'docs-merit-p':                   'Zorrito participates in the ACI Merit program (Aave Chan Initiative). ACI distributes extra USDT to USDT liquidity providers on Aave V3 on Celo.',
